<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Far East Int'l suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Far East Int'l suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Far East Holdings International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Monday.</p>
<p>Far East Holdings engages in property investment, cinema operation and leisure-related businesses.  </p>
<p>The company's shares fell HK$0.03 or 3.57 percent to HK$0.81 prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 78,000 shares worth HK$62,400.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
